err.log
build.log
cmake_config.log
.venv
xml/

# ---- src/PresentationEngine/, src/VGRScrapper/ etc. (Python + C++ backend,
# flattened directly into src/ alongside the Qt model files, 2026-09-19 —
# no longer under its own BelieversPresentationSoftware/ parent directory).
# Build artifacts and generated sermon-data dumps — regenerable, and
# together several GB, so never let a git add stage them by accident.
src/PresentationEngine/build/
src/PresentationEngine/build_asan/
src/downloads/
src/logs/
src/vgr_sermon_json/
src/vgr_sermons_pptx/
src/vgr_sermons_txt/
src/vgr_sermons_xml/
src/VGR_XML_JSON/
src/download*
# Keeps regenerating on its own at the repo root (just an empty
# .claude/skills/ stub) even after deletion — some external process still
# references the old pre-flatten path. Harmless; ignored rather than fought.
/BelieversPresentationSoftware/
*.log